      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></b></p><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">研究動機</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">近年來，都市環境對於居民身心健康影響議題，受到研究者與大眾的高度關注，由於受到全球都市化的影響，世界上有高比例的人口生活在都市，而且數量不斷在增加中。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">研究指出，人類在都市中的情緒感受，會隨著不同的空間與景觀元素產生變化，引發正向、負向的情緒表達，因此透過理解使用者對環境的情緒反應，是改善當代公共環境品質的重要指標。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">由於環境健康指標的建立缺乏參考依據，目前在研究與實務操作仍出現斷層，因此本系統開發目的希望提供城市規劃與設計者，透過情緒地圖檢視城市各區的發展現況，從使用者的生、心理層面理解物理環境的需求，做為營造正向情緒之都市環境參考。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">本研究參考</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Russell and Pratt (1980)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">環形情緒模型，評估人對於不同環境場景之情緒反應：</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">環形情緒模型將人類的情緒表現，以四維度</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">正向、負向、反應強、反應弱</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">分出四個象限歸類，本系統以此為架構，選定主要八項情緒進行解析，透過色彩表達人對照片之情緒反應</span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></p></span></span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>"
    }
  ]
